{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "BURGER RACE",
    "steam_appid": 3404360,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burger Race is a simple and fun game that anyone can enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every machine has a unique set of characteristics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you go with raw speed? Smooth handling? The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift and dash to zip around every corner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use items to make your opponents slip up and crash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect the unexpected as events occur during the race!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lights could suddenly go out, or nuggets could fall onto the track!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Time Attack\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a course and record your best time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with players from around the world on the online leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Free Race\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a course to run with friends and CPUs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With items and special events, the racing experience is totally different from Time Attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Grand Prix\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run through several courses of your choice in order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accumulate wins and become the grand champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy playing with up to 4 players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge friends and family for 1st place and have fun!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burger Race is a simple and fun game that anyone can enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every machine has a unique set of characteristics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you go with raw speed? Smooth handling? The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift and dash to zip around every corner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use items to make your opponents slip up and crash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect the unexpected as events occur during the race!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lights could suddenly go out, or nuggets could fall onto the track!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Time Attack\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a course and record your best time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with players from around the world on the online leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Free Race\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a course to run with friends and CPUs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With items and special events, the racing experience is totally different from Time Attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Grand Prix\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run through several courses of your choice in order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accumulate wins and become the grand champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy playing with up to 4 players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge friends and family for 1st place and have fun!</p>",
